.TH DICTATE-STATUS 1 "" "dictate" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dictate-status \- the dictation state as a tmux status segment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dictate-status
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the phase of
.BR dictate (1)
in tmux colours, or nothing when idle. Meant for
.B status-left
with
.BR "status-interval 1" .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dictate (1)
